orward+ | Compatibility\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b8279b2-a6f6-4205-b342-6fa3d2869a63\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3e0b123-2681-4d05-be72-2f2bfe75b16a\" />\r\n\r\nIn particular, the translucent Godot icon (the leftmost one) is significantly less visible in Compatibility compared to Forward+. It uses the default modulate color and **Albedo Mix** set to `0.5`.\r\n\r\nThe scene above uses no lights, an unshaded material and linear tonemapping, so it should look as close as possible between renderers otherwise.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_118070.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26681825/test_pr_118070.zip)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118070#pullrequestreview-4100475260","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118070","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-13T16:52:48Z"},{"id":4100482542,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc70aGXu","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"dc686746bbb62802c1ae6d2bbf24927baf065ba9","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118070#pullrequestreview-4100482542","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118070","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-13T16:54:13Z"},{"id":4103227610,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc70kkja","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"dc68674